<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cardápio - Restaurante Vila Nova</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style-site.css">
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <div class="header-container">
            <a href="/site" class="brand">
                <div>
                    <span class="brand-title">Vila Nova</span>
                    <span class="brand-subtitle">Restaurante & Gastronomia</span>
                </div>
            </a>
            <nav>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="/site">Início</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/site/cardapio" class="active">Cardápio</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/site/reserva">Fazer Reserva</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/site/minhas-reservas">Minhas Reservas</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/admin" class="btn-mode">Área Admin</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <h2 class="section-title">Nosso Cardápio</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Explore nossos pratos artesanais disponíveis hoje.</p>

        <div class="grid-cards">

            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544025162-d76694265947?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80"
                    alt="Costela Bovina" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <span class="badge badge-success">Disponível</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Costela Premium Assada</h3>
                    <p>Costela assada lentamente com legumes grelhados.</p>
                    <div class="card-price">R$ 89,90</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551183053-bf91a1d81141?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80"
                    alt="Massa Carbonara" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <span class="badge badge-success">Disponível</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Fettuccine Carbonara</h3>
                    <p>Massa artesanal, pancetta, gemas de ovos e queijo parmesão.</p>
                    <div class="card-price">R$ 54,00</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563805042-7684c019e1cb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80"
                    alt="Petit Gateau" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <span class="badge badge-success">Disponível</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Petit Gâteau de Chocolate</h3>
                    <p>Bolo quente de chocolate com sorvete de baunilha.</p>
                    <div class="card-price">R$ 28,00</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1510812431401-41d2bd2722f3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80"
                    alt="Vinho Tinto" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <span class="badge badge-danger">Esgotado</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Vinho Tinto Reserva</h3>
                    <p>Garrafa 750ml - Safra Especial.</p>
                    <div class="card-price">R$ 120,00</div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Restaurante Vila Nova. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </footer>

</body>

</html>